    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.121.0: mid-conversation tool changes beta, session budgets, advisor tool, pinned inference location, GitHub skills auto-loading; retired Opus 4.1 models removed. Built and verified on aarch64: 211 tests passed, rpmlint 0 errors / 0 warnings / 0 badness, source_validator clean.</comment>
    <requestid>1370299</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="10" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>aad65b07e5df2f36239be26f7391f4e5</srcmd5>
    <version>0.122.0</version>
    <time>1786738014</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.122.0

- Adds output_behavior to dream creation, exposes beta.messages.parse,
  stream and tool_runner on the Bedrock and Vertex clients, and fixes a
  batch of streaming-accumulator and client credential-handling bugs.
- No patches; runtime dependency metadata is unchanged from 0.121.0.
- Built locally for aarch64 against openSUSE:Factory:ARM: green,
  %check 211 tests passed for both python313 and python314 flavours,
  rpmlint 0 errors, 0 warnings, 0 badness. source_validator clean,
  spec-cleaner clean pass.</comment>
    <requestid>1371165</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="11" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>8f6ef0c04850830050dead45b120cfb4</srcmd5>
    <version>0.125.0</version>
    <time>1787235324</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 0.125.0:
  * Promote Files and Skills APIs to GA and add computer-use
    and browser-use toolsets
  * Add helpers for reading the workspace ID in response headers
  * Add managed-agents web-search config and self-hosted sandbox
    memory-store sync
  * Extend files, memory stores, skills and user-profile APIs
  * Drop the unsupported mid_conv_system content block
  * Compute platform headers without spawning a subprocess
  * Export ServiceUnavailableError, DeadlineExceededError and
    custom status errors from the package
  * Retry session-runner tool-result sends for at least the
    lease TTL and run synchronous session tools in a worker
    thread
</comment>
    <requestid>1372116</requestid>
  </revision>
